---
// The About page. Replace the text below with your own story.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
import { url } from '../lib/helpers';
---

<Base title="About" description={`About ${site.owner} and the collection.`}>
  <div class="wrap">
    <article class="reading">
      <h1>About the collection</h1>
      <div class="prose">
        <p class="lead">
          This is where you tell visitors who you are and how the collection began. Write it the way
          you would explain it to a guest standing in your living room.
        </p>
        <p>
          A few things people usually want to know: what first drew you to antiques, what ties the
          collection together, and how you choose a piece. Mention a favourite object or two, and
          link to it in the catalogue.
        </p>
        <p>
          You might also say whether you welcome questions from other collectors, researchers or
          dealers, and whether you ever lend pieces to exhibitions.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you would like to know more about any piece, <a href={url('contact/')}>write to me</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
